+    - ``*`` matches any run of characters (including empty) except ``/``.
+    - ``**`` as a whole path segment matches zero or more whole segments.
+    - ``[abc]``, ``[a-z]`` and ``[!a-z]`` match one character (never ``/``).
+    - A backslash escapes the next character, e.g. ``\\*`` matches ``*``.
+
+    Matching is case-sensitive and must match the whole path.
+    """
+    return _compile(pattern).fullmatch(path) is not None
